# Line endings.
#
# Shell scripts and the Dockerfile execute inside a Linux container. If Git
# checks them out with CRLF on a Windows machine and that reaches the image,
# the shebang becomes "#!/bin/sh\r" and Docker fails with
#
#   exec /usr/local/bin/docker-entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory
#
# which looks nothing like a line-ending problem. Pin them to LF everywhere.

* text=auto

*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.mjs       text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
